1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,975
The lighthouse had been dark for eleven

2
00:00:01,975 --> 00:00:04,975
years when the lamp came on by itself.

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,375
Did you see that?

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,575
Tell me you saw that.

5
00:00:10,225 --> 00:00:12,400
I saw it. I just don't want to have seen

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,275
it.

7
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,700
They took the coast road, because the

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,500
other road was gone.

9
00:00:18,275 --> 00:00:20,250
Somebody is up there, Tom.

10
00:00:21,025 --> 00:00:24,725
Nobody has been up there since the storm.

